WEBVTT

00:00:12.660 --> 00:00:14.310
Letter.

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.500
Oda Nobunaga-sama

00:00:22.250 --> 00:00:23.880
A letter.

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:27.750
From Ageha

00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:27.750
From Ageha?

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:29.640
What?! Ageha?!

00:02:17.380 --> 00:02:18.150
Ageha!

00:02:20.860 --> 00:02:22.170
Nobunaga-san?

00:02:23.950 --> 00:02:25.780
Ageha!

00:02:27.330 --> 00:02:30.080
Nobunaga-san!

00:02:41.750 --> 00:02:46.640
Ageha would never call 
me "Nobunaga-san."

00:02:47.540 --> 00:02:51.490
I'm sure you thought that fake 
letter would bring me out.

00:02:51.490 --> 00:02:54.640
But I won't be fooled by it.

00:02:55.810 --> 00:02:57.310
I see...

00:02:57.310 --> 00:02:59.400
How silly of me.

00:02:59.810 --> 00:03:03.280
You've done well to see through 
my disguise, Nobunaga!

00:03:03.970 --> 00:03:05.780
My name is Fuuma—

00:03:13.070 --> 00:03:20.220
At least let me finish 
saying my name...

00:03:21.260 --> 00:03:23.090
Oda Nobunaga.

00:03:27.470 --> 00:03:29.980
It's been a long time, Nobunaga.

00:03:29.980 --> 00:03:31.170
I see.

00:03:31.170 --> 00:03:32.400
So that's it.

00:03:33.160 --> 00:03:36.860
So you lured me out here 
with a fake letter.

00:03:36.860 --> 00:03:39.580
I see you're as underhanded as ever.

00:03:39.580 --> 00:03:41.530
Shut up!

00:03:41.530 --> 00:03:43.990
You fell for it, didn't you?

00:03:44.390 --> 00:03:46.960
Today I'll get you back for all

00:03:46.960 --> 00:03:49.240
the things you've done to me!

00:03:50.770 --> 00:03:54.170
You don't know what you've gotten yourself into.

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:58.920
I'm going to take both yours
and Sessai's treasures for my own!

00:03:58.920 --> 00:04:04.230
And you don't realize you've 
fallen into my trap!

00:04:28.360 --> 00:04:30.710
This fight was over the
second you came here,

00:04:30.710 --> 00:04:33.330
a place with an infinite supply of water.

00:04:33.870 --> 00:04:36.670
My plan is perfect!

00:04:40.370 --> 00:04:41.960
What's wrong?

00:04:41.960 --> 00:04:43.500
You're just running.

00:04:43.500 --> 00:04:45.760
Can't you fight back?

00:04:48.520 --> 00:04:51.060
Don't get cocky!

00:05:01.740 --> 00:05:02.480
Who's there?

00:05:03.580 --> 00:05:04.800
You're...

00:05:07.160 --> 00:05:09.380
Hojo So'un.

00:05:09.380 --> 00:05:13.250
I'm here to help Yoshimoto-sama.

00:05:16.010 --> 00:05:19.250
Yoshimoto-sama to her front, 
and So'un to her back.

00:05:19.790 --> 00:05:24.370
Even the Sweet Little Devil 
cannot get by those two.

00:05:24.990 --> 00:05:28.430
She's like a rat caught in a trap.

00:05:37.160 --> 00:05:39.120
Stay put!

00:05:39.120 --> 00:05:40.980
It's over!

00:05:41.500 --> 00:05:43.700
<i>I could handle Yoshimoto just fine,</i>

00:05:43.700 --> 00:05:46.660
<i>but with So'un here, it's 
a little difficult.</i>

00:05:47.380 --> 00:05:50.440
<i>I'll have to take out one first.</i>

00:05:55.010 --> 00:05:56.540
Now, Kotaro!

00:06:01.970 --> 00:06:04.030
You're mine!

00:06:14.870 --> 00:06:16.730
Fish!

00:06:19.490 --> 00:06:21.090
Surprised?!

00:06:21.090 --> 00:06:23.690
This is my Fuuma Ninja 
Technique: Playing Dea—

00:06:27.730 --> 00:06:28.980
Well?

00:06:28.980 --> 00:06:31.790
It's two versus one and 
you've lost your sword.

00:06:31.790 --> 00:06:33.860
You're helpless now.

00:06:35.460 --> 00:06:37.150
Now, So'un.

00:06:37.150 --> 00:06:38.830
Finish her.

00:06:40.890 --> 00:06:43.520
What's got you all down?

00:06:44.760 --> 00:06:48.250
We've basically won already.

00:06:48.250 --> 00:06:51.330
Finishing off an enemy 
we defeated easily

00:06:51.330 --> 00:06:53.980
doesn't get me fired up at all.

00:06:53.980 --> 00:06:56.850
Fired up? What's wrong with you?

00:06:57.220 --> 00:07:01.510
Fine, then I'll finish you myself!

00:07:09.150 --> 00:07:11.530
Nice work, Kotaro!

00:07:11.530 --> 00:07:13.370
Fuuma Ninja Technique: Cling—

00:07:17.080 --> 00:07:19.750
Nobunaga, prepare to die!

00:07:38.770 --> 00:07:40.220
Mitsuhide!

00:07:50.420 --> 00:07:52.530
Mitsuhide, what are you...

00:07:52.990 --> 00:07:54.490
We'll talk later.

00:07:54.490 --> 00:07:55.480
Here they come.

00:08:00.670 --> 00:08:05.060
Oda Nobunaga, who had almost 
conquered our old world,

00:08:05.060 --> 00:08:08.750
and Akechi Mitsuhide, her right hand.

00:08:09.210 --> 00:08:13.260
These two are definitely worthy opponents.

00:08:13.260 --> 00:08:16.360
I'm all fired up!

00:08:17.260 --> 00:08:20.510
Cursed Combustion!

00:08:29.270 --> 00:08:31.910
Hey, that's dangerous!

00:08:34.550 --> 00:08:37.200
You don't have time to 
yell at each other!

00:08:41.860 --> 00:08:44.540
Just because you've 
got reinforcements...

00:08:45.850 --> 00:08:47.750
Don't get cocky!

00:10:12.730 --> 00:10:14.000
Nobunaga-sama...

00:10:18.010 --> 00:10:22.010
This is the end!

00:10:44.590 --> 00:10:46.050
Did we get them?

00:10:48.430 --> 00:10:50.530
When did you...

00:10:50.530 --> 00:10:52.610
When you weren't paying attention.

00:10:57.140 --> 00:10:58.630
I've failed.

00:11:00.140 --> 00:11:01.980
We have no choice now...

00:11:06.320 --> 00:11:08.890
We give up.

00:11:26.840 --> 00:11:31.040
Now, as promised, I'm taking 
your secret treasures.

00:11:31.040 --> 00:11:32.270
Wait!

00:11:32.270 --> 00:11:34.250
When was that decided?

00:11:34.650 --> 00:11:36.210
Just now.

00:11:36.210 --> 00:11:37.370
By me.

00:11:38.260 --> 00:11:41.930
Yoshimoto-sama, no soldier 
wins every battle they fight.

00:11:41.930 --> 00:11:46.050
We should admit our defeat 
and try again another day.

00:11:46.050 --> 00:11:47.560
Indeed.

00:11:47.560 --> 00:11:51.670
I hate to admit it,
but you're my master, after all.

00:11:51.670 --> 00:11:55.480
You could at least die in 
a beautiful manner...

00:11:55.480 --> 00:11:58.730
Die? I'm not going to...

00:11:59.930 --> 00:12:01.900
Stop talking.

00:12:01.900 --> 00:12:04.450
And give up already.

00:12:06.250 --> 00:12:10.040
Your secret treasures are mine.

00:12:41.920 --> 00:12:43.180
Mitsuhide?

00:12:46.700 --> 00:12:48.030
What's wrong?

00:12:48.030 --> 00:12:50.190
I can handle this myself.

00:12:50.190 --> 00:12:52.340
I don't need your help.

00:12:53.350 --> 00:12:56.250
You are gathering the 
secret treasures of all

00:12:56.250 --> 00:12:59.660
the warring states generals sent here

00:12:59.660 --> 00:13:01.550
in order to return home.

00:13:03.380 --> 00:13:06.790
In other words, if you 
have enough of them,

00:13:06.790 --> 00:13:10.700
you alone will return home.

00:13:13.300 --> 00:13:17.320
Leaving me here...

00:13:26.870 --> 00:13:30.410
I am taking these secret treasures.

00:13:30.410 --> 00:13:31.490
What?

00:13:47.780 --> 00:13:49.550
Nobunaga-sama!

00:13:54.340 --> 00:13:55.260
Mitsuhide!

00:13:55.260 --> 00:13:56.820
What are you doing?

00:13:56.820 --> 00:14:01.320
I, Mitsuhide, will obtain
all the secret treasures

00:14:01.320 --> 00:14:03.230
that you plan on seeking.

00:14:03.230 --> 00:14:04.860
W-What?

00:14:05.290 --> 00:14:09.450
I won't let you go back home alone.

00:14:09.450 --> 00:14:11.840
Mitsuhide, what are you talking about?

00:14:11.840 --> 00:14:14.400
I won't!

00:14:14.400 --> 00:14:17.990
If I'm to be stuck here,

00:14:17.990 --> 00:14:21.380
then you'll have to stay here, too!

00:14:21.380 --> 00:14:27.150
I won't, won't, won't ever say goodbye!

00:14:28.240 --> 00:14:30.300
Hey, Mitsuhide!

00:14:30.680 --> 00:14:32.630
Wait!

00:14:58.340 --> 00:14:59.970
Jeez...

00:14:59.970 --> 00:15:02.380
What are they doing?

00:15:02.380 --> 00:15:03.510
But...

00:15:04.910 --> 00:15:07.140
They look like they're having fun!

00:15:24.550 --> 00:15:26.740
Huh? Huh?

00:15:26.740 --> 00:15:28.060
Where am I?

00:15:28.850 --> 00:15:31.700
Who are you?

00:15:31.700 --> 00:15:34.210
So'un's gone!

00:15:34.210 --> 00:15:35.800
Where did she go?

00:15:50.520 --> 00:15:51.680
Shinku...

00:15:52.140 --> 00:15:54.430
I'm back, Jun.

00:15:59.970 --> 00:16:01.480
Shinku!

00:16:03.370 --> 00:16:07.000
Come on, Jun, you don't have to cry.

00:16:07.000 --> 00:16:10.520
You came back, Shinku.

00:16:11.320 --> 00:16:12.760
I did.

00:16:21.870 --> 00:16:24.380
<b>A Ryutaro Ochiai Production 
"We finally caught the Kappa!"</b>

00:17:34.240 --> 00:17:39.200
<b>Chicken Wings 
A Taste from Space!!</b>

00:17:47.710 --> 00:17:52.710
<b>Kabayaki</b>
